{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget mercy. Forget salvation. There is nothing here but blood, steel, and light from cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where ancient Slavic rites are intertwined with the ashes of future technology, you are the last warrior of the Varangian Guard. Against you are hordes of cyber-mutants, obsessed cultists and traitors who have sold their flesh and faith for the power of a dark cult. In the style of Slavic Gothic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real boomer-shooter - old-school gameplay in the spirit of DOOM II, Duke Nukem and Quake. No cover, no reloading. Just you and your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult tech - an arsenal ranging from axes and archaic shotguns to and damn futuristic cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimdark universe - a mix of Slavic gothic and techno-cult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim enemies - from cultists, magi, sagittarians to cybernatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim locations - forgotten kapisches, industrial necropolises, ancient citadels and throne halls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack - True Metal</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3071860?t=1771942189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3071860?t=1771942189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071860/409517e1c6a5fd725b5e380d4af02aa970e08041/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771942189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071860/409517e1c6a5fd725b5e380d4af02aa970e08041/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771942189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game showcases pixelated blood, with enemies getting bloody wounds.\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3667830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget mercy. Forget salvation. There is nothing here but blood, steel, and light from cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where ancient Slavic rites are intertwined with the ashes of future technology, you are the last warrior of the Varangian Guard. Against you are hordes of cyber-mutants, obsessed cultists and traitors who have sold their flesh and faith for the power of a dark cult. In the style of Slavic Gothic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real boomer-shooter - old-school gameplay in the spirit of DOOM II, Duke Nukem and Quake. No cover, no reloading. Just you and your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult tech - an arsenal ranging from axes and archaic shotguns to and damn futuristic cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimdark universe - a mix of Slavic gothic and techno-cult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim enemies - from cultists, magi, sagittarians to cybernatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim locations - forgotten kapisches, industrial necropolises, ancient citadels and throne halls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack - True Metal</p></li></ul>","developers":["MrArcivorum"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071860/bb9827123a744f7b901208a5a86e2881dc4480c6/header.jpg?t=1771942189","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel / AMD CPU 1.2GHz+ (AVX2 support)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</